# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=libxxf86vm
pkgver=1.1.6
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="X11 video mode extension library"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://www.x.org/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(libxext)
source=("https://www.x.org/releases/individual/lib/libXxf86vm-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('96af414c73ce1d5449ad04be7f9f27fa8330f844b6dda843ef22e3e1befb3ee3')

build() {
    cd libXxf86vm-$pkgver
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/var --disable-static
    make
}

package() {
    cd libXxf86vm-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
